<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 613 mln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 613 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction July 8 versus July 1.</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   189/196		340/347</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.14/3.15	    3.38/3.39</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.14/3.15	    3.38/3.39</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.13/3.15	    3.37/3.39</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   490/20		 123/1,674</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    914/25		 243/1,759</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 46,338 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
